        "Title": "Stealing Until Nobody&apos;s Original",
        "Location": "LOCATION_EDGY_FOX",
        "PublicId": "129246246080",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 47793909-6ffb-4fe0-b1a4-a5307cf96423).Image",
        "Description": "Our client&apos;s musical library was stolen to train an A.I. model by Otto Sommer and Ludwig Leer who are now using it to flood the scene with A.I. algorithm-slop. Reinhold Stauss finesses social media platforms with deepfaked musicians while Siegmund Amsel secretly manages the financials.  They plan to hijack the setlist with their A.I. dubstep crap... You have to stop them.\r\rAnd the ICA has sent Agent Tremaine to bury this operation permanently.\r\rUse the radio tower for vantage. Good luck.",
